keting application for {!Account.IATA_Number__c} has been received and is now under review.</span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0;margin-top:0px;">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;"><span style="font-size:inherit;">To further strengthen our fraud prevention and cyber security controls, additional validation checks are now required as part of the Ticketing Authority approval process. As a result, processing times may be longer than normal.</span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;"><span style="font-size:inherit;">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0px;"><span style="font-size:inherit;">Note applications will be delayed if:</span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:inherit;">incomplete or inaccurate information has been supplied</span></li><li><span style="font-size:inherit;">Consultation is required with local sales representatives</span></li><li><span style="font-size:inherit;">During high demand periods</span></li></ul><p style="margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0;margin-top:0px;"><br></p><p style="margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0;margin-top:0px;"><span style="font-size:inherit;">Kind regards,</span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0;margin-top:0px;">&nbsp;</p><p style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 20px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;"><span data-teams="true"></span></p><p style="margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0;margin-top:0px;"><span style="font-size:inherit;">E-Ticketing team</span></p><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009189EC0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000000918A120" style="font-variant-ligatur